\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces StiXpert architecture. STIX knowledge and data-centre resources are combined with broader solar-physics context and software, including SSWIDL routines relevant to multiple instruments. These indexed resources are made available to an MCP-compatible AI client for knowledge retrieval and scientific discovery, with code assistance as a possible subsequent step. The diagram depicts the knowledge and service boundary; it does not imply autonomous scientific validation or execution by the knowledge-base server. }}{4}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{4}{StiXpert architecture. STIX knowledge and data-centre resources are combined with broader solar-physics context and software, including SSWIDL routines relevant to multiple instruments. These indexed resources are made available to an MCP-compatible AI client for knowledge retrieval and scientific discovery, with code assistance as a possible subsequent step. The diagram depicts the knowledge and service boundary; it does not imply autonomous scientific validation or execution by the knowledge-base server}{figure.caption.1}{}}
